{"sha": "c2ab25e1ee6cfef91d23090de4e37e88ec0f740bc8ebcb9e438bbef66af7ea55", "body": ["\\textbf{20.} $\\cot\\frac\\theta2 - \\cot\\theta =", "\\frac{\\cos\\frac\\theta2\\,\\sin\\theta -", "\\cos\\theta\\,\\sin\\frac\\theta2}{\\sin\\frac\\theta2\\,\\sin\\theta}", "= \\frac{\\sin\\frac\\theta2}{\\sin\\frac\\theta2\\,\\sin\\theta} =", "\\frac1{\\sin\\theta}$，分子为 $\\sin(\\theta -", "\\frac\\theta2)$。取 $\\theta = \\pi z$，则练习 9 在", "$\\frac z2$ 处的式子为 $\\pi\\cot\\frac{\\pi z}2 = \\frac2z +", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{4z}{z^2 - 4n^2}$，于是", "\\[", "\\frac{\\pi}{\\sin(\\pi z)}", "= \\pi\\cot\\frac{\\pi z}2 - \\pi\\cot(\\pi z)", "= \\frac1z + \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{4z}{z^2 - 4n^2}", "- \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{2z}{z^2 - n^2} .", "\\]", "绝对收敛允许按奇偶性重新分组：偶数 $n", "= 2m$ 在被减级数中贡献", "$\\frac{2z}{z^2-4m^2}$，第一个和式则留下 $+\\frac{2z}{z^2-4m^2}$，", "而奇数 $n$ 以符号 $-$ 保留：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\pi}{\\sin(\\pi z)} = \\frac1z +", "\\sum_{n\\geq1}(-1)^n\\,\\frac{2z}{z^2 - n^2} .", "\\]", "符号检验：$\\operatorname{Res}\\bigl(\\pi/\\sin(\\pi z),", "n\\bigr) = \\pi/(\\pi\\cos\\pi n) = (-1)^n$", "（见\\cref{met:b3:residues:compute}），且 $(-1)^n\\frac{2z}{z^2 -", "n^2} = \\frac{(-1)^n}{z-n} + \\frac{(-1)^n}{z+n}$ 在", "$\\pm n$ 处恰好具有该留数。", "", "\\textbf{21.} 设 $\\abs z \\leq r < 1$，按", "练习 19 的方式展开每一项（$(-1)^n\\frac{2z}{z^2-n^2} =", "(-1)^{n-1}\\frac{2z}{n^2}\\sum_k\\frac{z^{2k}}{n^{2k}}$），并", "应用富比尼定理：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\pi}{\\sin(\\pi z)} = \\frac1z +", "2\\sum_{k\\geq0}\\eta(2k+2)\\,z^{2k+1},", "\\qquad", "\\eta(s) = \\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{n^s} .", "\\]", "泰勒展开一侧：$\\sin(\\pi z) = \\pi z(1 - \\frac{(\\pi z)^2}6 +", "O(z^4))$ 给出 $\\frac\\pi{\\sin\\pi z} = \\frac1z +", "\\frac{\\pi^2}6z + O(z^3)$：$2\\eta(2) = \\frac{\\pi^2}6$，于是", "$\\eta(2) = \\frac{\\pi^2}{12}$。一致性检验：$\\eta(2) =", "\\zeta(2) - 2\\sum_n(2n)^{-2} = (1 - 2^{1-2})\\zeta(2) =", "\\frac{\\zeta(2)}2 = \\frac{\\pi^2}{12}$.", "", "\\textbf{22.} 取 $z = \\frac12$，由练习 20 可得", "\\[", "\\pi = 2 + \\sum_{n\\geq1}(-1)^n\\frac{1}{\\frac14 - n^2}", "= 2 + 4\\sum_{n\\geq1}\\frac{(-1)^{n-1}}{(2n-1)(2n+1)} .", "\\]", "利用 $\\frac1{(2n-1)(2n+1)} = \\frac12\\bigl(\\frac1{2n-1} -", "\\frac1{2n+1}\\bigr)$，两个交错级数均", "收敛（由莱布尼茨判别法），和式分解为 $\\frac12\\bigl[L -", "(1 - L)\\bigr] = L - \\frac12$，其中 $L = 1 - \\frac13 +", "\\frac15 - \\cdots$ 且 $\\frac13 - \\frac15 + \\frac17 - \\cdots", "= 1 - L$。于是 $\\pi = 2 + 4(L - \\frac12) = 4L$：", "\\[", "\\frac\\pi4 = 1 - \\frac13 + \\frac15 - \\frac17 + \\cdots", "\\]", "小结：每个核都是亚纯函数，其极点位于一个", "等差数列上，并带有给定的留数。", "余切在每个整数处留数为 $1$，并对", "$f(n)$ 求和；其导数使极点平方，并", "给出 $\\lambda(2)$；正切把极点移至", "$\\frac12 + \\Z$ 处，并给出奇数分母对应的值；$\\pi/\\sin$ 保留", "整数极点，但留数交替为 $(-1)^n$，故", "出现交错级数。一阶核全是", "奇函数：将 $n$ 与 $-n$ 配对，使偶次幂系数加倍，", "奇次幂系数则消为零，故 $\\zeta(2k)$", "可机械地得出，而 $\\zeta(3)$ 从不出现。", "这一盲区源于奇偶性，而非技巧上的欠缺。", "", "\\textbf{23.} 取 $w = 2\\iu\\pi z$：", "\\[", "\\iu\\pi z + \\frac{2\\iu\\pi z}{\\eu^{2\\iu\\pi z} - 1}", "= \\iu\\pi z\\,\\frac{\\eu^{2\\iu\\pi z} + 1}{\\eu^{2\\iu\\pi z} - 1}", "= \\iu\\pi z\\,\\frac{\\eu^{\\iu\\pi z} +", "\\eu^{-\\iu\\pi z}}{\\eu^{\\iu\\pi z} - \\eu^{-\\iu\\pi z}}", "= \\pi z\\,\\frac{\\cos\\pi z}{\\sin\\pi z} = \\pi z\\cot(\\pi z) .", "\\]", "由此，对 $w = 2\\iu\\pi z$ 利用生成函数（并", "$B_1 = -\\frac12$ 消去 $\\iu\\pi z$ 项，奇数 $B$", "在此之后均为零）：", "\\[", "\\pi z\\cot(\\pi z) = \\sum_{k\\geq0}\\frac{B_{2k}}{(2k)!}", "(2\\iu\\pi z)^{2k}", "= 1 + \\sum_{k\\geq1}(-1)^k\\frac{(2\\pi)^{2k}B_{2k}}{(2k)!}", "z^{2k} .", "\\]", "另一方面，由部分分式展开（第 IV 部分）", "得 $\\pi z\\cot(\\pi z) = 1 - 2\\sum_{k\\geq1}\\zeta(2k)z^{2k}$", "（逐项展开 $\\frac{2z^2}{z^2 - n^2} =", "-2\\sum_k\\frac{z^{2k}}{n^{2k}}$，并对 $n$ 求和，正规", "收敛使得在 $\\abs z < 1$ 时可交换求和次序）。", "比较系数：$-2\\zeta(2k) =", "(-1)^k\\frac{(2\\pi)^{2k}B_{2k}}{(2k)!}$，即所给公式。", "", "\\textbf{24.} $k = 1$: $\\frac{(2\\pi)^2}{2\\cdot2}\\cdot\\frac16", "= \\frac{\\pi^2}6$. $k = 2$: $-\\frac{(2\\pi)^4}{2\\cdot24}", "\\cdot\\bigl(-\\frac1{30}\\bigr) = \\frac{16\\pi^4}{48\\cdot30} =", "\\frac{\\pi^4}{90}$. $k = 3$: $\\frac{(2\\pi)^6}{2\\cdot720}", "\\cdot\\frac1{42} = \\frac{64\\pi^6}{1440\\cdot42} =", "\\frac{\\pi^6}{945}$.", "", "\\textbf{25.} 记 $C(z) = \\pi z\\cot(\\pi z) = 1 -", "2\\sum_{k\\geq1}\\zeta(2k)z^{2k}$（见练习 23）。直接", "对 $C = \\pi z\\cot(\\pi z)$，利用 $(\\cot u)'", "= -1 - \\cot^2u$:", "\\[", "zC'(z) = \\pi z\\cot(\\pi z) - \\pi^2z^2\\bigl(1 +", "\\cot^2(\\pi z)\\bigr) = C - \\pi^2z^2 - C^2 .", "\\]", "现将两边按 $z^2$ 的幂展开。左边：", "$\\sum_k(-4k)\\,\\zeta(2k)\\,z^{2k}$。右边：将", "级数平方，", "\\[", "C - C^2 = 2\\sum_{k\\geq1}\\zeta(2k)z^{2k}", "- 4\\sum_{k\\geq2}\\Bigl(\\sum_{j=1}^{k-1}\\zeta(2j)", "\\zeta(2k-2j)\\Bigr)z^{2k},", "\\]", "而项 $-\\pi^2z^2 = -6\\zeta(2)z^2$ 只影响 $k =", "1$ 的情形。比较 $z^{2k}$ 的系数（$k \\geq 2$）：", "\\[", "-4k\\,\\zeta(2k) = 2\\,\\zeta(2k) -", "4\\sum_{j=1}^{k-1}\\zeta(2j)\\,\\zeta(2k-2j),", "\\]", "即 $\\bigl(k + \\frac12\\bigr)\\zeta(2k) =", "\\sum_{j=1}^{k-1}\\zeta(2j)\\zeta(2k-2j)$。（当 $k = 1$ 时", "恒等式为 $-4\\zeta(2) = 2\\zeta(2) - 6\\zeta(2)$：一", "个一致性检验，而非新信息）。应用：$k =", "2$：$\\frac52\\zeta(4) = \\zeta(2)^2 = \\frac{\\pi^4}{36}$，故", "$\\zeta(4) = \\frac{\\pi^4}{90}$；$k = 3$：$\\frac72\\zeta(6) =", "2\\zeta(2)\\zeta(4) = \\frac{\\pi^6}{270}$，故 $\\zeta(6) =", "\\frac{2}{7}\\cdot\\frac{\\pi^6}{270} = \\frac{\\pi^6}{945}$。只", "需一个超越起点（$\\zeta(2) = \\frac{\\pi^2}6$），纯代数便", "可生成全部偶数指标的 ζ 值。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}